[{"title":"游神乐观期耦君武孟不至明日耦君有诗见寄遂用韵答之","author":"王绂","text":"退直乘閒暂出城，岧峣仙观壮神京。\n坛边人拥青鸾帚，花外谁调彩凤笙。\n斋殿风微香馥郁，醴泉云冷鉴澄清。\n题诗无限登临兴，独欠君来未畅情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26224,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代作送大学士黄静庵先生拜封归永嘉","author":"王绂","text":"贤郎禄养正宜留，底事匆匆买去舟。\n世泽共推家学在，荣封重沐圣恩优。\n一帆烟水离京口，两岸云山过越州。\n遥想到家秋正好，亲朋诗酒乐林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26225,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送石宪使中美之四川","author":"王绂","text":"持斧远临西蜀去，绣衣荣作外台臣。\n威行一道霜风肃，恩被重霄雨露新。\n剑阁山川当岁晚，锦城花柳待阳春。\n驱驰好叱王尊驭，圣主深怀在远人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26226,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别蓬庵","author":"王绂","text":"染翰年年直禁闱，此身生计未应微。\n惯听风雨蓬为屋，小凿池塘竹映扉。\n在客亦知聊暂泊，出门那忍遽相违。\n山灵不用移文诮，滋味依然一布衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26227,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从出京","author":"王绂","text":"二月阳和驾北巡，两京佳气蔼晴旻。\n寰瀛共仰乾坤大，草木均沾雨露春。\n仗簇五云常捧日，兵严万骑不惊尘。\n菲材自愧浑无赖，载笔叨荣列从臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26228,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月九日瞻望大驾渡江作","author":"王绂","text":"风送龙舟正落潮，山形盘踞郁岧峣。\n帝图久已超三代，王气何曾数六朝。\n樯橹中流江路迥，旌旗夹岸海天遥。\n只今万国歌游豫，不独康衢稚子谣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26229,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜次淮安西关","author":"王绂","text":"独客微吟夜不眠，官航初换宿淮堧。\n烟深灯火津桥市，月下帆樯贾客船。\n千里河流长不息，两城更鼓互相传。\n含情未得询陈迹，韩信祠荒草满阡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26230,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓入清河舟中眺望","author":"王绂","text":"风帆晓入清河口，野岸晴飞白鸟群。\n水入淮流千里合，路通齐地一支分。\n驰心辇下常看日，回首江东已隔云。\n试问县楼应不远，夜来更鼓月中闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26231,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行得便风快甚民望索诗遂赋","author":"王绂","text":"舟泛长江一苇轻，棹歌齐发浪花生。\n才看帆腹添风力，便觉船头响涧声。\n涉远底须登陆路，凭虚真欲上苍冥。\n题诗为报偕行客，同是鹍鹏十万程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26232,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄京师诸友","author":"王绂","text":"法驾时巡出紫宸，从行犹及布衣臣。\n驱驰不觉离情远，感激惟知宠渥新。\n乡信到时应岁晚，征途随处逐阳春。\n两京宫阙遥相望，云树沉沉入梦频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26233,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登剑台望京华作","author":"王绂","text":"一上高台首重回，五云何处是蓬莱。\n帆随雁影天边去，人共春光日下来。\n淮甸烟销平似掌，河流冰泮碧于苔。\n翠华行幸应非远，佳气氤氲绕上台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26234,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄同舍余彦行乡友","author":"王绂","text":"髫年交谊在乡闾，老大京华共客居。\n分手又经千里远，对床空忆两年馀。\n春风禁苑莺声早，暮雨关河雁影疏。\n聚散人生那可料，平安须用托缄书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26235,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊徐州","author":"王绂","text":"楼船今夜宿彭城，楚汉当时此战争。\n帝业定知归有道，兵家尤忌出无名。\n废兴旧迹馀山色，今古流年逐水声。\n感慨独吟眠未得，忍看孤月照人明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26236,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静夜","author":"王绂","text":"夜久篆烟凝，欲眠方掩扃。\n梧桐窗外月，悭到枕边屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26237,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉","author":"王绂","text":"嫩绿开如扇，不禁风雨秋。\n都来浑几叶，作出许多愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26238,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其一 种菊","author":"王绂","text":"根宜宿土随，疏列可分移。\n只恐人轻触，先教护短篱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26239,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其二 灌菊","author":"王绂","text":"灌时须趁晓，日出露将晞。\n栽后无多日，苗添几叶肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26240,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其三 催菊","author":"王绂","text":"种尔酬佳节，节过开尚迟。\n纵令迟更好，争似莫愆期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26241,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其四 探菊","author":"王绂","text":"无日不相访，殷勤直到开。\n一从栽种后，篱落几徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26242,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其五 删菊","author":"王绂","text":"秋来菊覆畦，青蕊著枝时。\n蕊少花方好，浑消三两枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26243,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其六 折菊","author":"王绂","text":"秋来开几丛，宛见晋人风。\n折向东屏笑，樽中酒可空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26244,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其七 移菊","author":"王绂","text":"篱下开虽好，盆中看亦宜。\n金钱盈屋里，宁敢富翁欺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26245,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其八 玩菊","author":"王绂","text":"篱畔醉黄花，巾披一幅纱。\n浊醪还自酿，何必向邻赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26246,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其九 餐菊","author":"王绂","text":"秋菊可餐服，落英多晚香。\n不知骚赋后，才思有谁强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26247,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和董校书秋香十咏 其十 对菊","author":"王绂","text":"浊酒几番醉，黄花千古秋。\n酒香花正好，不必漫生愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26248,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其一 容春阁","author":"王绂","text":"一醉更无事，四时长有花。\n谁知春去尽，却独在君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26249,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其二 水石轩","author":"王绂","text":"人生贵自适，于焉乐所遇。\n开轩水石间，无限湖山趣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26250,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其三 涵翠亭","author":"王绂","text":"亭前竹色好，亭下池水宽。\n平波浸寒影，古镜飞青鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26251,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其四 秀石","author":"王绂","text":"米老拜为丈，我复结为友。\n坚贞太古心，天地同不朽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26252,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其五 方池","author":"王绂","text":"斋前凿方池，聊以供涤砚。\n云影与天光，波静时时见。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26253,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其六 桂屏","author":"王绂","text":"疑是广寒物，金翠何灿灿。\n香风四面围，经霜犹不散。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26254,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其七 柏屏","author":"王绂","text":"香叶多攀结，铜柯巧屈蟠。\n苍龙倚檐外，翠壁耸高寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26255,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其八 黄杨","author":"王绂","text":"结盖多川产，盘根盛吴中。\n清风记赋笔，允矣欧阳公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26256,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其九 木香架","author":"王绂","text":"柔条架低屋，紫心开玉团。\n摘花酿芳醑，清香入肺肝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26257,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹园十咏 其十 蒲石","author":"王绂","text":"爱此九节蒲，托根一拳石。\n晴窗风日妍，相看眼逾碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26258,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题斗方山水","author":"王绂","text":"雨过乱泉流，风声满树头。\n山斋如斗大，容得许多秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26259,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":